        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to race! This arcade-style racing game delivers fast-paced action, colorful tracks, and a fun singleplayer experience against smart AI drivers. Perfect for quick races, drifting challenges, or chasing your best lap time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏎️ Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Singleplayer Racing – Compete against AI opponents in exciting races.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Tracks– Race across diverse environments, from city streets to winding hills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arcade Drifting – Master the art of drift and push your skills to the limit.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Time Trial Mode – Challenge yourself to set new records and climb the leaderboards.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Full Controller Support – Enjoy smooth driving with gamepads, steering wheels, or keyboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Low-Spec Friendly– Optimized to run smoothly on a wide range of PCs.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your car, hit the track, and put your racing skills to the test! Each race brings different challenges, from sharp turns that demand precision drifting to straightaways that test your speed. Whether you’re a casual gamer or a racing enthusiast, you’ll find quick and fun races that keep you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Why You’ll Love It</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to pick up, fun to master.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bright, colorful visuals designed for an arcade racing feel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Offline gameplay—no internet required to enjoy the full experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to drift past the competition and cross the finish line first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
